WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:02.480
Welcome to MgRonald's!

00:06.940 --> 00:08.980
Chi, can I have a sec?

00:10.230 --> 00:13.490
Sorry. This is about my shouting, isn't it?

00:13.490 --> 00:16.660
You need to give your daily life
the respect it deserves.

00:16.660 --> 00:20.370
If you go on like this, Miss Kisaki 
won't promote you to the second floor.

00:20.370 --> 00:22.310
You're right.

00:22.310 --> 00:27.160
But even without the voice thing, 
I don't think I can make it up there.

00:27.160 --> 00:29.380
Yeah, I get that.

00:29.920 --> 00:33.880
How does she make coffee that good?

00:34.340 --> 00:39.390
Right? She's using the same 
pot and beans we do.

00:39.390 --> 00:41.720
What's her secret?

00:41.720 --> 00:42.900
Yeah...

00:44.390 --> 00:45.900
Welco—

00:46.740 --> 00:48.460
Welcome to MgRonald's.

01:08.830 --> 01:10.920
<b>The Devil is a Part-Timer! Season 2</b>

02:19.990 --> 02:24.950
m 370 218 l 609 218 609 245 370 245

02:21.550 --> 02:22.990
Be careful going home, Chi.

02:21.620 --> 02:24.950
<b>The Devil and the Hero Question Their Daily Routine</b>

02:21.620 --> 02:24.950
<b>The Devil and the Hero Question Their Daily Routine</b>

02:22.990 --> 02:25.780
I will! Good night.

02:22.990 --> 02:27.000
<b>Women's Changing Room</b>

02:26.140 --> 02:29.370
If you need help, just holler 
in that big voice you trained.

02:32.430 --> 02:34.900
H-How am I supposed to respond to that?!

02:34.900 --> 02:37.690
Anyway, be careful. Also...

02:37.690 --> 02:38.880
What now?

02:39.390 --> 02:41.890
Thank you for working so hard.

02:43.650 --> 02:45.560
I realized I hadn't said that yet.

02:45.560 --> 02:49.230
I-It's not like I'm <i>only</i> 
doing it for you, Mr. Maou!

02:53.200 --> 02:55.630
How goes Chi's shouting problem?

02:55.660 --> 03:00.740
There were some close calls, but she's
 more or less back to normal.

03:01.500 --> 03:05.990
I see... Maybe Chi's 
found her next goal, too.

03:05.990 --> 03:09.500
"Too"? What do you mean?

03:11.560 --> 03:14.000
Nothing. Don't worry about it.

03:16.410 --> 03:21.010
Miss Kisaki! How can I brew 
coffee as good as yours?

03:22.760 --> 03:24.260
<b>The MgRonald's Barista Training Course</b>

03:24.260 --> 03:27.770
<b>The MgRonald's Barista Training Course</b>

03:25.080 --> 03:27.770
"MgRonald's Barista Training"?

03:27.770 --> 03:29.770
Are you familiar with the word "barista"?

03:32.650 --> 03:34.270
Fire the ballista!

03:36.100 --> 03:38.530
No, never heard of it.

03:39.010 --> 03:41.330
"Barista" is an Italian word.

03:41.330 --> 03:43.780
Many people think it refers to 
someone who only makes coffee,

03:43.780 --> 03:49.200
but it's actually someone who makes 
nonalcoholic beverages, including coffee.

03:49.200 --> 03:50.700
I had no idea.

03:51.350 --> 03:53.360
Some baristas specialize not only
in making beverages,

03:53.360 --> 03:56.660
but in handling everything from 
the equipment to the customers.

03:56.670 --> 03:58.590
They call themselves "barmen."

03:59.880 --> 04:02.550
My goal is to be a barman.

04:03.950 --> 04:08.060
You're going to be amazing when 
you rise through the ranks at MgR's!

04:08.750 --> 04:11.440
At MgR's...?

04:11.440 --> 04:12.560
That's not...

04:14.060 --> 04:17.290
Never mind. If you want to be as good as me,

04:17.290 --> 04:19.320
why don't you take this course?

04:19.790 --> 04:22.270
You've got experience as a shift manager,

04:22.270 --> 04:24.320
so they should waive the fee for you.

04:25.200 --> 04:26.280
Right...

04:31.310 --> 04:33.330
Welcome home, Sire.

04:33.330 --> 04:35.920
Suzuno's still awake?

04:35.920 --> 04:37.880
Miss Sasaki is visiting.

04:38.690 --> 04:42.090
I wouldn't be surprised if they're 
practicing techniques again.

04:42.090 --> 04:45.720
But it's past midnight! Sheesh.

04:46.350 --> 04:48.360
Chi? You in there?

04:49.450 --> 04:51.690
Go home! It's late.

04:52.190 --> 04:54.980
Quiet down, Satan, and stop 
pretending you're her guardian.

04:54.980 --> 04:57.910
The good Chiho's mother 
has already given permission

04:57.910 --> 05:00.070
for her to stay here tonight.

05:00.070 --> 05:02.230
Oh, uh, she has?

05:03.660 --> 05:05.100
Yes, she has.

05:05.720 --> 05:06.990
I'm sorry.

05:06.990 --> 05:10.990
Well, I'll just say, uh, 
don't overwork yourself.

05:10.990 --> 05:12.280
Right!

05:12.280 --> 05:17.020
I'll take perfectly good care 
of her without your input.

05:17.020 --> 05:22.000
We've finished training and were 
enjoying some girls' talk when you came.

05:22.410 --> 05:24.470
You're not needed here.

05:26.360 --> 05:28.760
"Girls' talk," my ass.

05:30.030 --> 05:33.270
"Daily life" is an unlucky phrase, huh?

05:33.750 --> 05:34.980
What's with you?

05:36.630 --> 05:40.520
I was just thinkin' about how 
people change before you know it.

05:41.020 --> 05:44.380
I guess "daily life" doesn't mean 
the same life from day to day.

05:44.380 --> 05:49.030
It just means that time's 
movin' at an invisible pace.

05:49.030 --> 05:54.040
Where's this coming from? 
Are you losing it, too?

05:54.630 --> 05:59.040
That's <i>why</i> life is fun. It'd be messed up 
for nothing to ever change.

05:59.040 --> 06:01.290
You're the <i>last</i> person 
I wanna hear that from!

06:01.670 --> 06:06.050
Pretty sure I know it more intimately 
than anyone else, actually.

06:07.800 --> 06:11.270
Then how about you allow us to 
better perceive your daily evolution

06:11.270 --> 06:13.310
by doing some chores?

06:14.950 --> 06:18.310
I'll admit that unchanging 
routines are important, too.

06:20.630 --> 06:22.070
I must say,

06:22.070 --> 06:25.820
I didn't expect you to be able to 
stably activate it in just one week.

06:26.340 --> 06:29.620
It might be time for us to move 
to basic idea link training.

06:29.620 --> 06:31.070
Really?!

06:31.070 --> 06:33.470
You've got the aptitude.

06:33.470 --> 06:38.210
If you'd been born in Ente Isla, you 
might've become a great Celestialist.

06:38.210 --> 06:40.460
Aw, no way...

06:41.620 --> 06:42.790
This is selfish,

06:42.790 --> 06:47.210
but I wish you all could just forget 
about the complicated Ente Isla stuff,

06:47.700 --> 06:51.970
and the daily life we have 
now could go on forever.

06:52.320 --> 06:56.140
I think that could only happen 
if we all got along really well.

06:57.800 --> 07:02.230
But... Miss Yusa has been 
really struggling with something.

07:02.230 --> 07:06.440
It feels like she treats Mister Maou 
differently now, too.

07:10.490 --> 07:14.990
The Devil turned out not to be the 
father-killer that Emilia wanted revenge on.

07:15.960 --> 07:21.000
More importantly, her father 
apparently isn't even dead.

07:21.850 --> 07:27.200
Up until now, vengeance and duty have 
been the only things spurring her on.

07:27.760 --> 07:31.750
After losing those things, 
she can't figure out what to do next.

07:32.900 --> 07:35.640
That's probably why she 
decided to secure your safety

07:35.640 --> 07:38.270
by teaching you the arts.

07:39.480 --> 07:44.400
I also think it's better if Emilia turns 
her focus from the Devil for a while.

07:44.400 --> 07:47.390
Fortunately, MgRonald's is open again.

07:47.390 --> 07:49.030
What do you mean?

07:49.800 --> 07:52.950
Sariel is at the SFC 
across the street, isn't he?

07:52.950 --> 07:55.580
That'll keep Father Olba and any demons

07:55.580 --> 07:57.780
from getting close to the Devil so easily.

07:57.780 --> 08:03.040
Oh, um, I'm not sure we can 
rely on that right now.

08:03.040 --> 08:06.540
<b>Sentucky</b>

08:03.510 --> 08:06.540
What do you mean we can't rely on Sariel?

08:06.540 --> 08:09.300
According to the good Chiho...

08:09.550 --> 08:11.170
My goddess!

08:11.170 --> 08:15.700
What are you doing 
with my crew, Mitsuki Sarue?

08:17.460 --> 08:19.810
I-It's... a negotiation?

08:19.810 --> 08:22.310
You're banned from the shop 
until further notice!

08:26.680 --> 08:30.460
She says the dejection has left him 
an empty husk ever since.

08:30.460 --> 08:32.710
He's certainly taking a while to appear.

08:32.710 --> 08:34.700
Maybe he went home already?

08:34.700 --> 08:37.980
No, I can faintly sense his presence here.

08:37.980 --> 08:40.600
He may be hiding behind shelves 
or between pieces of furniture.

08:40.930 --> 08:43.040
He's not a cockroach...

08:43.670 --> 08:49.090
But he must be really weakened if his 
power feels faint at such close range.

08:49.740 --> 08:50.710
Good night, sir.

08:57.120 --> 08:59.710
Hold on, is that really Sariel?!

09:01.020 --> 09:02.720
Beautiful!

09:04.930 --> 09:06.710
He's a shadow of his former self.

09:08.080 --> 09:09.360
Now what?

09:17.280 --> 09:20.280
<b>Heaven's Château Hatagaya</b>

09:20.280 --> 09:22.620
"Heaven's Château," my butt.

09:25.490 --> 09:29.100
Look—that's the manager of the MgRonald's.

09:33.780 --> 09:35.550
My goddess!

09:39.050 --> 09:43.640
Was my goddess here just now?! 
Answer me, Crestia Bel!

09:44.310 --> 09:46.900
She was, wasn't she?!

09:44.310 --> 09:46.900
C-Calm down, Sariel, please!

09:46.900 --> 09:51.600
So what if she was? Let Bel go, 
or I'll call the police.

09:51.600 --> 09:53.480
She was here...

09:54.190 --> 09:57.840
I can tell! This is the scent of my goddess!

09:57.840 --> 10:00.820
The scent of her personally brewed coffee!

10:01.420 --> 10:03.070
Gross!

10:05.790 --> 10:11.010
Why do I have to go through this 
headache to protect the Devil?

10:17.080 --> 10:22.510
Up until now, vengeance and duty have 
been the only things spurring her on.

10:22.950 --> 10:26.730
After losing those things, 
she can't figure out what to do next.

10:27.350 --> 10:30.280
<i>I wonder what Mister Maou thinks.</i>

10:30.610 --> 10:32.970
<i>I want to hear it directly from him.</i>

10:32.970 --> 10:35.830
<i>If I can get him alone, we'll have time.</i>

10:35.830 --> 10:38.700
Huh? A-Alone?

10:38.700 --> 10:40.360
Like a da—

10:40.360 --> 10:42.360
Got something on your mind?

10:42.980 --> 10:45.510
I-I was spacing out and...

10:45.510 --> 10:47.870
How could you tell?

10:47.870 --> 10:51.290
I'm feeling anxious right now myself.

10:51.290 --> 10:54.130
It's given me a sixth sense 
for those in the same boat.

10:54.510 --> 10:56.630
You get anxious too, Miss Kisaki?

10:57.330 --> 10:59.420
I'm only human, you know.

11:03.500 --> 11:06.430
But we have to start with 
what's right in front of us.

11:06.430 --> 11:09.230
What you and I need to do right now, Chi...

11:09.770 --> 11:12.150
is our work at MgRonald's.

11:12.610 --> 11:13.380
Right?

11:13.380 --> 11:14.580
Huh?

11:14.580 --> 11:17.400
Y-Yes, ma'am! You're right.

11:19.980 --> 11:21.410
Miss Kisaki...

11:23.760 --> 11:27.400
So you're taking the barista course too, huh?

11:27.400 --> 11:28.660
Yep!

11:30.310 --> 11:31.160
Listen—

11:32.350 --> 11:35.670
Oh, did you two just get off work?

11:37.210 --> 11:38.920
What do you want with me?

11:39.590 --> 11:42.430
Why, got something on your conscience?

11:42.430 --> 11:46.430
Excuse me?! Is this your usual 
"make an excuse to pick a fight" act?

11:47.990 --> 11:50.010
An excuse?

11:50.010 --> 11:53.940
What, does the Hero always need 
a reason to visit the Devil's place?

11:56.060 --> 11:57.590
What's with you?

11:57.900 --> 11:59.690
You've been acting weird lately.

12:04.690 --> 12:05.950
Miss Yusa?

12:08.610 --> 12:11.900
Emilia's dad is alive out there somewhere.

12:11.900 --> 12:13.790
All I did was tell her so.

12:13.790 --> 12:18.670
Just so you know, I'm still angry, 
and I don't intend to forgive you.

12:20.640 --> 12:21.740
Hey, Emi.

12:22.340 --> 12:23.340
What?

12:24.630 --> 12:28.840
Maybe the human world just isn't for me.

12:29.960 --> 12:32.820
Seems like there's lots 
of demons waiting for me,

12:32.820 --> 12:35.650
so maybe I should call Camio to come fetch me

12:36.480 --> 12:39.270
and get back to taking over the world.

12:42.960 --> 12:46.160
Mister Maou, you don't mean that, right?

12:46.160 --> 12:48.660
This never made sense anyway.

12:49.540 --> 12:54.120
I led a hundred-plus tribes in the demon 
realm—over 500,000 demons total.

12:54.120 --> 12:58.460
Why would the leader of the Devil's army 
need to learn about the human world?

12:59.840 --> 13:02.820
The Devil and the Hero's 
positions are irreconcilable.

13:03.510 --> 13:10.060
I'll pull out all the stops on my evil brutality, 
so you come try to kill me again.

13:11.040 --> 13:13.060
I'm sure Ashiya'll be thrilled.

13:13.910 --> 13:16.650
Or we could drive Japan into a panic.

13:17.690 --> 13:19.560
As if you would.

13:20.970 --> 13:25.330
I know you can't do that, and I know
 you don't intend to, so shut up!

13:26.170 --> 13:29.830
Miss Kisaki will come running 
if you shout too much.

13:29.830 --> 13:32.390
What is it you want to do?

13:32.390 --> 13:35.460
I told you: take over the world.

13:35.460 --> 13:37.950
No, I mean <i>after</i> that!

13:39.480 --> 13:44.970
You'll rule a world that holds no appeal 
for demons other than lots of humans to kill.

13:44.970 --> 13:46.470
Then what?

13:48.380 --> 13:51.720
Then how about I plunge 
the world into despair?

13:52.200 --> 13:56.740
It's patently obvious you don't mean that.

13:57.300 --> 13:58.550
If you—

13:58.960 --> 14:03.240
If you really were just a cruel, 
bloodthirsty demon king, I wouldn't...

14:03.690 --> 14:06.240
I wouldn't be struggling with this so much!

14:06.710 --> 14:08.240
Miss Yusa...

14:08.720 --> 14:11.490
You never wanted to conquer the world!

14:11.490 --> 14:12.650
I think...

14:13.460 --> 14:18.250
you just wanted someone to 
recognize you for doing something big!

14:26.140 --> 14:27.760
M-Mister Maou?!

14:31.310 --> 14:36.270
Well, maybe that saved me from 
saying something I shouldn't,

14:36.680 --> 14:40.770
but not getting to clap back 
has me pretty grumpy.

14:40.900 --> 14:43.860
So, who are you two?

14:44.270 --> 14:48.450
State your name, say your piece, 
and scram once you're satisfied.

14:48.890 --> 14:53.280
Or else I'll vent my frustrations on you.

14:53.720 --> 14:55.460
King Satan...

14:56.690 --> 14:58.770
My name is Farfarello.

14:58.770 --> 15:03.050
I have the honor of being one 
of the leaders of the Malebranche.

15:03.050 --> 15:04.790
Figured you were a demon.

15:05.710 --> 15:09.550
How about you, samurai doll? 
Are you a demon, too?

15:10.500 --> 15:13.120
Erone. Human.

15:13.120 --> 15:15.490
What are you doing with a demon?

15:15.490 --> 15:16.560
Orders.

15:16.560 --> 15:19.560
Uh-huh. So what do you want with me?

15:20.590 --> 15:26.820
We Malebranche have captured Ente Isla's 
strongpoint, the eastern continent.

15:26.820 --> 15:30.960
Therefore we would like to ask you 
to return and join us in—

15:29.720 --> 15:31.320
Nope, don't wanna!

15:31.770 --> 15:32.820
Pardon?

15:32.820 --> 15:35.830
Don't you "Pardon?" me. Go home!

15:35.830 --> 15:37.720
Why, Your Majesty?

15:39.310 --> 15:40.330
No service?

15:40.330 --> 15:42.250
What's happened?!

15:42.250 --> 15:43.900
Could this be the work of...

15:44.420 --> 15:45.550
A demon.

15:51.730 --> 15:52.850
It's a magical barrier.

15:52.850 --> 15:55.100
My goddess!

15:55.600 --> 15:57.010
I've come to save you!

15:57.100 --> 15:58.600
Light of Iron!

16:04.350 --> 16:06.110
Is my goddess safe?!

16:06.510 --> 16:09.330
Nothing's happened to Manager Kisaki.

16:09.670 --> 16:11.610
Wait, where's Chiho?

16:12.230 --> 16:13.950
What does this mean?

16:13.950 --> 16:17.120
Why would an ordinary barrier 
make someone disappear?

16:17.120 --> 16:19.510
It's not an ordinary barrier.

16:20.420 --> 16:22.460
It's a dimensional phase shifter.

16:24.130 --> 16:27.630
I already told Ciriatto that 
I didn't want to come back.

16:27.630 --> 16:32.880
Besides, do I seem like the type to 
wrestle in another man's fundoshi?

16:33.450 --> 16:35.480
"Another man's fundoshi"?

16:37.620 --> 16:40.420
Learn some Japanese 
before you come to Japan!

16:40.420 --> 16:42.640
A fundoshi is a type of underwear!

16:42.640 --> 16:45.180
In sumo wrestling, 
Japan's traditional martial art,

16:45.180 --> 16:47.590
you're only allowed to wear a fundoshi!

16:47.590 --> 16:50.210
Which makes the fundoshi like armor—

16:50.210 --> 16:54.400
In other words, you win if you 
destroy the opponent's underwear?

16:54.400 --> 16:55.680
Don't destroy it!

16:55.680 --> 16:58.960
I'm saying I can't fight 
in another man's underwear!

16:58.960 --> 17:00.170
I see.

17:00.170 --> 17:04.350
Sumo wrestlers actually 
wear mawashi, not fundoshi.

17:04.350 --> 17:06.170
Oh yeah, you're right!

17:06.170 --> 17:09.420
Wait, so why is it "fundoshi" in the idiom?

17:09.420 --> 17:12.080
A long time ago, they wore fundoshi instead.

17:12.690 --> 17:15.180
Ch-Chi?! What are you doing here?

17:15.790 --> 17:18.680
You mustn't take Mister Maou back to Ente Isla!

17:18.680 --> 17:21.180
He still has things to do in Japan, so—

17:22.070 --> 17:23.620
Stand back, Chi.

17:23.620 --> 17:28.190
Is what she says true, Your Majesty?

17:28.190 --> 17:34.760
What "things to do" have you 
protecting a human, exactly?

17:35.170 --> 17:38.620
Don't tell me you've abandoned us.

17:38.620 --> 17:39.530
Screw you!

17:40.630 --> 17:42.540
I've never forgotten and <i>will</i> never forget

17:42.540 --> 17:46.290
the demon realm or the troops 
who respected and followed me!

17:47.280 --> 17:49.640
I'm just a king who never knew
what "world conquest" meant,

17:49.640 --> 17:52.130
who spread blood and
tragedy everywhere

17:52.130 --> 17:56.300
and thought only about 
expanding demon territory.

17:56.980 --> 18:00.290
If I walk that same path of ruin again,

18:00.290 --> 18:03.810
the Hero really will kill me, 
and the demon realm will be doomed!

18:03.810 --> 18:07.310
We will not repeat the mistakes we made before!

18:07.310 --> 18:09.660
If we refuse to change the path we walk,

18:09.660 --> 18:11.830
the world won't change either!

18:12.860 --> 18:14.320
I'll only say this once more:

18:14.990 --> 18:17.690
Withdraw from the eastern continent 
and return to the demon realm.

18:18.070 --> 18:23.330
Ciriatto will smooth the way for you, 
and Camio won't punish you.

18:23.680 --> 18:29.550
Sire, when Olba said this 
country had defanged you,

18:29.550 --> 18:31.900
I didn't believe him.

18:32.940 --> 18:35.390
But if it's true...

18:36.870 --> 18:41.090
You'll kill me and Barbariccia 
will declare himself the new king?

18:41.610 --> 18:42.470
No.

18:43.330 --> 18:45.090
Please accept this.

18:45.090 --> 18:46.370
What is it?

18:46.370 --> 18:49.050
Condensed magic.

18:49.050 --> 18:54.520
If you consume it, I believe it will 
restore your heart's former ferocity.

18:55.010 --> 18:57.510
Very well, I'll hold on to it.

18:57.510 --> 18:59.790
My feelings won't change, though.

18:59.790 --> 19:02.910
Hold on to it? Please, Sire, eat it now.

19:03.430 --> 19:05.280
Why the hurry?

19:05.280 --> 19:06.790
Well...

19:07.510 --> 19:08.540
Breaking.

19:11.040 --> 19:12.650
Heavenly Fang of Light!

19:16.120 --> 19:17.680
E-Emi?!

19:17.680 --> 19:18.980
Miss Suzuno!

19:19.440 --> 19:21.090
I see you two are all right.

19:21.830 --> 19:23.380
Emilia! Bel!

19:23.380 --> 19:27.060
The one creating this barrier is the kid!

19:27.590 --> 19:30.560
You disappeared in the middle 
of the fight I picked.

19:30.920 --> 19:32.730
Talk about making me grumpy.

19:32.730 --> 19:34.560
That's my line!

19:34.560 --> 19:39.640
Well, I got pretty violent breaking 
this barrier, so I feel better now.

19:39.640 --> 19:41.000
Are you kidding me?

19:41.000 --> 19:43.820
Leave them to me. You guard Chiho.

19:44.530 --> 19:45.330
Right.

19:45.330 --> 19:46.580
Who are you?

19:47.100 --> 19:51.830
Oh, haven't you seen me before? 
You're a demon, aren't you?

19:52.180 --> 19:54.830
Y-You can't be...

19:55.650 --> 19:59.580
Emilia Justina. Carve my name 
into your memory.

20:10.100 --> 20:12.760
If you forget everything you saw here

20:12.760 --> 20:16.860
and live out your years quietly 
in the demon realm, I'll let you slide.

20:16.860 --> 20:21.610
But make one wrong move, and I'll
 cut your head off right now.

20:22.080 --> 20:24.860
Once again, she says stuff a Hero shouldn't.

20:25.620 --> 20:27.120
Erone!

20:30.520 --> 20:32.040
Halt!

20:37.180 --> 20:38.560
Holy Mirror Flare!

20:53.240 --> 20:54.590
Erone?

20:55.230 --> 20:58.230
Mama! Erone! No!

20:58.770 --> 21:01.440
Don't punish Erone!

21:04.880 --> 21:06.190
Please!

21:06.190 --> 21:06.740
Huh?

21:06.740 --> 21:09.240
Why are you dawdling?!

21:09.240 --> 21:11.660
Gaze of the Fall!

21:17.940 --> 21:18.750
Erone...

21:18.750 --> 21:20.750
W-We'll withdraw.

21:26.420 --> 21:30.010
Your Majesty, I shall be back to fetch you.

21:30.010 --> 21:33.520
Says the guy being carried by a kid.

21:33.840 --> 21:36.650
Do you two think you can escape my—

21:37.260 --> 21:38.520
What?!

21:40.070 --> 21:41.020
You're useless.

21:41.020 --> 21:42.320
Excuse me?!

21:42.320 --> 21:46.460
Still, I guess you helped us, 
so I'll say thanks.

21:46.970 --> 21:49.030
And Suzuno, are you okay?

21:50.280 --> 21:53.620
No broken bones, but he got me good.

21:55.070 --> 21:56.530
Miss Yusa?

21:56.530 --> 21:58.660
That Erone kid...

21:59.440 --> 22:01.670
may be like Alas Ramus.

22:03.670 --> 22:08.620
Yesod is me! Geburah is Erone!
